  "prefLabel": "Tax 215.03 Filing Deadlines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 215.03 Filing Deadlines. The filing deadlines for discretionary easement, revitalization, betterment assessment, qualifying historic buildings, farm structures and land under farm structures, and qualifying chartered public school appeals shall be as stated in RSA 79-C:5, RSA 79-D:5, RSA 79-E:4, RSA 79-F:6, RSA 79-G:5, RSA 79-H:5, and RSA 231:32.\n\nSource. #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
